%% expect: Idle|Loading the document|Rendering the visible range|Parsing|Laying out|file opened by the user|parse finished without errors|Failed to load|retry after the user fixes the file|Only the visible blocks are rendered first
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> LoadingDoc : file opened by the user
    state "Loading the document" as LoadingDoc
    state "Rendering the visible range" as Rendering {
        [*] --> Parsing
        Parsing --> LayingOut : parse finished without errors
        state "Laying out" as LayingOut
        LayingOut --> [*]
    }
    LoadingDoc --> Rendering
    LoadingDoc --> Failed : disk read failed or file is too large
    state "Failed to load" as Failed
    Failed --> Idle : retry after the user fixes the file
    Rendering --> Idle : user closes the tab
    note right of Rendering
        Only the visible blocks are rendered first
    end note
    Rendering --> [*]
